{"seq":1,"slug":"opam-dune-toolchain","title":"Opam 与 Dune 工具链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/ecosystem/opam-dune-toolchain","wordCount":1157,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"opam-与-dune-工具链\">Opam 与 Dune 工具链</h1><p>OCaml 的开发体验在过去几年经历了根本性提升，其核心是两个工具的成熟：Opam（包管理器）和 Dune（构建系统）。它们共同提供了从依赖管理、项目构建到发布的完整工作流。配合 OCaml LSP（编辑器支持）、odoc（文档生成）、OCamlformat（代码格式化），形成了一套现代化的开发平台工具链（OCaml Platform）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>OCaml Platform 由一圈各司其职的工具构成，理解它们的分工比记住命令更重要。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>核心命题</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>直接后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>switch</td>\n<td>隔离的编译器 + 库环境</td>\n<td>不同项目可用不同 OCaml 版本互不干扰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>opam</td>\n<td>包管理器与中央仓库</td>\n<td>声明依赖、求解版本、锁定与发布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dune</td>\n<td>声明式构建系统</td>\n<td>用 <code>dune</code> 文件描述构建规则而非脚本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周边工具</td>\n<td>LSP / odoc / ocamlformat 各自独立</td>\n<td>编辑器反馈、文档生成、格式化各司其职</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话概括：opam 负责「有哪些依赖、装在哪」，Dune 负责「怎么构建」，其余工具围绕这两者提供开发体验。下面依次展开 Opam 的环境隔离、Dune 的声明式构建、项目结构约定，以及 LSP、ocamlformat、odoc 等配套工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"opam-包管理与环境隔离\">Opam：包管理与环境隔离</h2><p>Opam 是 OCaml 的包管理器，管理着包含 4000+ 包的中央仓库。其核心概念是 switch——隔离的编译器环境，类似于 Python 的 virtualenv 或 Rust 的 toolchain：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 创建新 switch（指定编译器版本）&#10;opam switch create my-project ocaml.5.5.0&#10;&#10;# OCaml 5.5 的可重定位编译器允许克隆已有 switch&#10;# 而非重新编译——显著加速 switch 创建&#10;opam switch create fast-clone --clone=my-project&#10;&#10;# 安装依赖&#10;opam install dune eio_main cmdliner fmt logs&#10;&#10;# 锁定依赖版本&#10;opam lock .\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 创建新 switch（指定编译器版本）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">opam</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> switch</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-project</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ocaml.5.5.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># OCaml 5.5 的可重定位编译器允许克隆已有 switch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 而非重新编译——显著加速 switch 创建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">opam</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> switch</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fast-clone</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --clone=my-project</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装依赖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">opam</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dune</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> eio_main</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cmdliner</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fmt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> logs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 锁定依赖版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">opam</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lock</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Opam 的依赖求解器基于 CUDF（Common Upgradeability Description Format），能在包版本约束形成的复杂图中找到可满足的安装方案：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Opam 概念</th>\n<th>对应</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>switch</td>\n<td>Python venv / Rust toolchain</td>\n<td>隔离的编译器+库环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>opam file</td>\n<td>Cargo.toml / package.json</td>\n<td>包元数据与依赖声明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>opam.lock</td>\n<td>Cargo.lock / package-lock.json</td>\n<td>精确版本锁定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>opam repository</td>\n<td>crates.io / npm registry</td>\n<td>中央包仓库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pin</td>\n<td>path dependency</td>\n<td>开发时指向本地源码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[opam-repository] --&gt; B[依赖求解器 CUDF]&#10;    C[*.opam 文件] --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; D{可满足?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[下载 + 编译 + 安装]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[报告冲突]&#10;    E --&gt; G[switch 中可用]&#10;    H[opam.lock] --&gt; E\">flowchart LR\n    A[opam-repository] --&gt; B[依赖求解器 CUDF]\n    C[*.opam 文件] --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; D{可满足?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[下载 + 编译 + 安装]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[报告冲突]\n    E --&gt; G[switch 中可用]\n    H[opam.lock] --&gt; E</pre><h2 id=\"dune-声明式构建系统\">Dune：声明式构建系统</h2><p>Dune 是 OCaml 生态的事实标准构建系统。项目通过 <code>dune-project</code> 文件声明元信息，通过每个目录的 <code>dune</code> 文件声明构建规则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"lisp\" data-code=\"; dune-project（项目根目录）&#10;(lang dune 3.16)&#10;(name my_http_server)&#10;(generate_opam_files true)&#10;&#10;(package&#10; (name my_http_server)&#10; (depends&#10;  (ocaml (&gt;= 5.2.0))&#10;  (eio_main (&gt;= 1.0))&#10;  (cohttp-eio (&gt;= 6.0))&#10;  (cmdliner (&gt;= 1.2))))&#10;&#10;; src/dune（源码目录）&#10;(library&#10; (name http_core)&#10; (libraries eio cohttp-eio logs))&#10;&#10;; bin/dune（可执行文件目录）&#10;(executable&#10; (name main)&#10; (public_name my_http_server)&#10; (libraries http_core cmdliner eio_main))&#10;&#10;; test/dune（测试目录）&#10;(test&#10; (name test_http)&#10; (libraries http_core alcotest eio_mock))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>; dune-project（项目根目录）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(lang dune 3.16)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(name my_http_server)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(generate_opam_files true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(package</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (name my_http_server)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (depends</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (ocaml (>= 5.2.0))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (eio_main (>= 1.0))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (cohttp-eio (>= 6.0))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (cmdliner (>= 1.2))))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>; src/dune（源码目录）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(library</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (name http_core)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (libraries eio cohttp-eio logs))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>; bin/dune（可执行文件目录）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(executable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (name main)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (public_name my_http_server)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (libraries http_core cmdliner eio_main))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>; test/dune（测试目录）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (name test_http)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (libraries http_core alcotest eio_mock))</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Dune 的核心设计决策：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 基本命令&#10;dune build              # 构建项目&#10;dune test               # 运行测试&#10;dune exec bin/main.exe  # 构建并执行&#10;dune fmt                # 格式化（需安装 ocamlformat）&#10;dune clean              # 清理构建产物&#10;&#10;# 开发模式&#10;dune build --watch      # 文件修改时自动重新构建&#10;dune test --watch       # 持续运行测试&#10;&#10;# 发布工作流&#10;dune-release tag        # 基于 CHANGES.md 创建 tag&#10;dune-release distrib    # 创建发布归档&#10;dune-release publish    # 发布到 opam-repository\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 基本命令</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dune</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">              # 构建项目</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dune</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">               # 运行测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dune</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> exec</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bin/main.exe</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 构建并执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dune</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fmt</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                # 格式化（需安装 ocamlformat）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dune</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clean</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">              # 清理构建产物</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 开发模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dune</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --watch</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # 文件修改时自动重新构建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dune</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --watch</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # 持续运行测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 发布工作流</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dune-release</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tag</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 基于 CHANGES.md 创建 tag</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dune-release</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> distrib</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 创建发布归档</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dune-release</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> publish</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 发布到 opam-repository</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"项目结构最佳实践\">项目结构最佳实践</h2><p>一个典型的 OCaml 项目结构遵循 Dune 的约定：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"my-project/&#10;├── dune-project          # 项目元信息&#10;├── my_project.opam       # 包描述（可由 dune 生成）&#10;├── CHANGES.md            # 变更日志&#10;├── lib/                  # 库代码&#10;│   ├── dune              # (library ...)&#10;│   ├── core.ml           # 实现&#10;│   └── core.mli          # 接口&#10;├── bin/                  # 可执行文件&#10;│   ├── dune              # (executable ...)&#10;│   └── main.ml&#10;├── test/                 # 测试&#10;│   ├── dune              # (test ...)&#10;│   └── test_core.ml&#10;└── .ocamlformat          # 格式化配置\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>my-project/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── dune-project          # 项目元信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── my_project.opam       # 包描述（可由 dune 生成）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── CHANGES.md            # 变更日志</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── lib/                  # 库代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── dune              # (library ...)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── core.ml           # 实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── core.mli          # 接口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── bin/                  # 可执行文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── dune              # (executable ...)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── main.ml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── test/                 # 测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── dune              # (test ...)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── test_core.ml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── .ocamlformat          # 格式化配置</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约定</th>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>库名</td>\n<td><code>snake_case</code></td>\n<td>Dune 要求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模块名</td>\n<td><code>PascalCase</code>（自动从文件名映射）</td>\n<td>OCaml 模块命名规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>公开库名</td>\n<td><code>dune-project</code> 中的 <code>public_name</code></td>\n<td>安装后的库名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试</td>\n<td>与被测库同级目录或 <code>test/</code></td>\n<td>就近原则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ppx</td>\n<td>独立 <code>(library ... (kind ppx_rewriter))</code></td>\n<td>编译期工具独立</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"ocaml-lsp-与编辑器集成\">OCaml LSP 与编辑器集成</h2><p>OCaml Language Server Protocol（<code>ocaml-lsp-server</code>）基于 Merlin 引擎，提供完整的编辑器支持：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"opam install ocaml-lsp-server ocamlformat&#10;&#10;# VS Code 安装 OCaml Platform 扩展即自动连接 LSP\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">opam</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ocaml-lsp-server</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ocamlformat</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># VS Code 安装 OCaml Platform 扩展即自动连接 LSP</span></span></code></pre></div><p>LSP 提供的功能：类型悬停显示、自动补全（包括模块路径）、跳转到定义/实现、查找引用、重命名、内联代码操作、诊断（编译错误实时显示）、代码格式化。</p>\n<p>Merlin 的核心能力是增量式类型检查——修改单个文件时只重新分析受影响的部分，响应时间保持在毫秒级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ocamlformat-统一代码风格\">OCamlformat：统一代码风格</h2><p>OCamlformat 基于自定义的 AST pretty-printer，确保代码格式完全确定性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"; .ocamlformat（项目根目录）&#10;version = 0.27.0&#10;profile = default&#10;margin = 90&#10;module-item-spacing = compact&#10;break-cases = fit&#10;if-then-else = k-r\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>; .ocamlformat（项目根目录）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>version = 0.27.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>profile = default</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>margin = 90</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module-item-spacing = compact</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>break-cases = fit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if-then-else = k-r</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Dune 集成使得格式化成为构建流程的一部分：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"dune fmt           # 格式化所有文件&#10;dune fmt --check   # CI 中检查是否已格式化\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dune</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fmt</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           # 格式化所有文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dune</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fmt</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --check</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # CI 中检查是否已格式化</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"odoc-从类型生成文档\">Odoc：从类型生成文档</h2><p>odoc 从 <code>.mli</code> 文件和 doc-comments 生成 HTML 文档，深度集成 OCaml 的类型系统：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"(** [create ~capacity] creates a new buffer.&#10;&#10;    @param capacity Initial capacity in bytes. Must be positive.&#10;    @raise Invalid_argument if [capacity &lt;= 0].&#10;    @since 2.1.0&#10;&#10;    {[&#10;      let buf = create ~capacity:1024 in&#10;      push buf &quot;hello&quot;&#10;    ]}&#10;*)&#10;val create : capacity:int -&gt; t\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(** [create ~capacity] creates a new buffer.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @param capacity Initial capacity in bytes. Must be positive.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @raise Invalid_argument if [capacity &#x3C;= 0].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @since 2.1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {[</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      let buf = create ~capacity:1024 in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      push buf \"hello\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ]}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>*)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val create : capacity:int -> t</span></span></code></pre></div><p>odoc 的独特优势是它理解 OCaml 的模块系统——交叉引用可以指向任何模块路径中的值或类型，并在生成的文档中正确链接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"开发工作流集成\">开发工作流集成</h2><p>完整的日常开发循环：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 1. 创建项目&#10;mkdir my-project &amp;&amp; cd my-project&#10;opam switch create . ocaml.5.5.0 --deps-only&#10;&#10;# 2. 开发循环&#10;dune build --watch &amp;     # 后台持续构建&#10;# 编辑代码...&#10;dune test                # 运行测试&#10;&#10;# 3. CI 检查（lefthook/pre-commit 中配置）&#10;dune fmt --check &amp;&amp; dune build &amp;&amp; dune test&#10;&#10;# 4. 发布&#10;dune-release tag &amp;&amp; dune-release distrib &amp;&amp; dune-release publish\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1. 创建项目</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mkdir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-project</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-project</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">opam</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> switch</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ocaml.5.5.0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --deps-only</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2. 开发循环</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dune</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --watch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 后台持续构建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 编辑代码...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dune</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                # 运行测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 3. CI 检查（lefthook/pre-commit 中配置）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dune</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fmt</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --check</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dune</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dune</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 4. 发布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dune-release</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dune-release</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> distrib</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dune-release</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> publish</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>switch 是环境隔离单元</strong>：不同项目可用不同编译器版本互不干扰，OCaml 5.5 的可重定位编译器还允许 <code>--clone</code> 已有 switch 而非重新编译。</li>\n<li><strong>opam 负责依赖的声明、求解与锁定</strong>：求解器基于 CUDF，<code>opam.lock</code> 提供精确版本锁定，<code>pin</code> 可在开发时指向本地源码。</li>\n<li><strong>Dune 是声明式构建系统</strong>：<code>dune-project</code> 声明元信息、每目录 <code>dune</code> 声明规则，<code>--watch</code> 支持持续构建，<code>dune-release</code> 覆盖发布流程。</li>\n<li><strong>项目结构遵循约定</strong>：<code>lib/</code> 放库、<code>bin/</code> 放可执行、<code>test/</code> 放测试，库名 <code>snake_case</code>、模块名自动映射为 <code>PascalCase</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>配套工具各司其职</strong>：<code>ocaml-lsp-server</code>（基于 Merlin 的增量类型检查）提供编辑器智能感知，ocamlformat 保证格式确定性，odoc 从 <code>.mli</code> 与 doc-comment 生成文档。</li>\n<li><strong>完整循环已成型</strong>：从编辑器即时反馈、终端快速构建到 CI 可靠验证（<code>dune fmt --check &amp;&amp; dune build &amp;&amp; dune test</code>）与发布，全程无需离开 OCaml 生态。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这套工具链的成熟，正是 OCaml 从「学术语言」走向「可用于生产」的关键基础设施之一。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Opam 与 Dune 工具链","id":"opam-与-dune-工具链"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Opam：包管理与环境隔离","id":"opam-包管理与环境隔离"},{"level":2,"text":"Dune：声明式构建系统","id":"dune-声明式构建系统"},{"level":2,"text":"项目结构最佳实践","id":"项目结构最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"OCaml LSP 与编辑器集成","id":"ocaml-lsp-与编辑器集成"},{"level":2,"text":"OCamlformat：统一代码风格","id":"ocamlformat-统一代码风格"},{"level":2,"text":"Odoc：从类型生成文档","id":"odoc-从类型生成文档"},{"level":2,"text":"开发工作流集成","id":"开发工作流集成"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"异步 IO 与 Eio","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/concurrency-effects/async-io-eio"},"next":{"title":"OCaml 编译器内部","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/ecosystem/ocaml-compiler-internals"}}